    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διοικο-δομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>build across, wall off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.90
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to set a partition-wall between:</i> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσθμὸν καὶ ὅρον δ. τῆς τε κεφαλῆς
					καὶ τοῦ στήθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					69e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοῦ θώρακος . . τὸ
			κύτος</span> ibid. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>barricade,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.56
				</span></i>
			.</div>
